=========================
MOUSE ACTIONS IN PLAYWRIGHT
=========================

WHAT ARE MOUSE ACTIONS?
-----------------------

Mouse actions simulate user interactions with the mouse.

Examples:

✔ Click
✔ Double Click
✔ Right Click
✔ Hover
✔ Drag and Drop

--------------------------------------------------

1. SINGLE CLICK
---------------

Used to click a button, link, checkbox, etc.

Syntax:

await locator.click();

Example:

await page
.locator('#login-button')
.click();

--------------------------------------------------

2. DOUBLE CLICK
---------------

Used when application requires
double-click action.

Syntax:

await locator.dblclick();

Example:

await page
.locator('#edit-file')
.dblclick();

--------------------------------------------------

3. RIGHT CLICK
--------------

Also called Context Click.

Used to open context menu.

Syntax:

await locator.click({
    button: 'right'
});

Example:

await page
.locator('#file')
.click({
    button: 'right'
});

--------------------------------------------------

4. HOVER
--------

Moves mouse over an element.

Used for:

✔ Menus
✔ Tooltips
✔ Hidden options

Syntax:

await locator.hover();

Example:

await page
.locator('.menu')
.hover();

--------------------------------------------------

5. DRAG AND DROP
----------------

Used to move an element from
one location to another.

Syntax:

await source.dragTo(target);

Example:

await page
.locator('#source')
.dragTo(
    page.locator('#target')
);

--------------------------------------------------

ALTERNATIVE DRAG & DROP
-----------------------

await page.mouse.down();

await page.mouse.move(
    x,
    y
);

await page.mouse.up();

Used for advanced scenarios.

--------------------------------------------------

INTERVIEW QUESTIONS
-------------------

Q. How do you perform a right click?

Answer:

